      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-y/q7-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"Substituting gives 2187 −729[1 −(2/3)7]/(1 −2/3). [M1] Here (2/3)7 = 128/2187, so S7 = 2187(1 −128/2187) . = 2059 The finite sum is 2059, so the required value is 2187 −2059 = 128 . [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
      "<p class=\"madas-total\">Total mark for question 7 is 10 marks.</p>"
